          "text": "{\"report\":{\"source_url\":\"https://hemisfair.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/05.25.2021-RFP-Hemisfair-Augmented-Reality-Project.pdf\",\"requirement_ids\":[\"R1\",\"R2\",\"R3\",\"R4\",\"R5\",\"R6\",\"R7\",\"R8\",\"R9\"],\"exclusions\":[\"Historic July 2, 2021 proposal deadline and 2021/2023 rollout dates are not current commitments.\",\"QR badge installation is assigned to HPARC staff, not the vendor. Tower Park and additions for future phases, historic structures or amenities are potential future scope, not guaranteed baseline work.\",\"Spanish translation is conditional. The all-model device wording is retained as a requested target, not proof of feasible or tested support.\",\"Brand assets, donor media/permissions, CMS accounts and release credentials are unavailable. No physical work, deployment, donor publication or procurement is authorized; FAQ output would be a proposed draft only.\"],\"delivery_status\":\"not_executed\",\"summary\":\"Scoping summary for a historical Hemisfair AR tree-donor recognition app request covering two parks, QR/GPS activation, donor content, maps/search, CMS, training, FAQ draft, and support. Missing evidence includes current commitments, assets, permissions, credentials, feasibility across all devices, and authorization for deployment or procurement.\"}}"
